          {
            "q": "How do you ensure safety?",
            "a": "Dual rating system, reliability scores (0-100), verified profiles with photos, in-app chat (no phone sharing), and automated trust scoring based on behavior."
          },
          {
            "q": "What about payment integration?",
            "a": "Architecture is ready for Razorpay/Stripe integration. Transaction system is fully built and tested. Currently simulated for demo purposes."
          },
          {
            "q": "How does the AI pricing work?",
            "a": "Base price (₹4/km) × Demand multiplier. Analyzes ±3 days bookings + saved routes. High demand (+20%), Moderate (+10%), Low (0%). Example: 150km = ₹648-₹792."
          },
